{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57902","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57902","key":"SV-11408","fields":{"summary":"Tech View and Board View: first-run state when there are no work orders at all","parent":{"id":"56387","key":"SV-10043","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56387","fields":{"summary":"Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10004","description":"This work item is being actively worked on at the moment by the assignee.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"In Progress","id":"10004","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"Epics track collections of related bugs, stories, and tasks. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10306?size=medium","name":"Epic","subtask":false,"avatarId":10306,"entityId":"b16adb77-4b77-44c6-9be7-926745903790","hierarchyLevel":1}}},"attachment":[],"description":"h3. What\n\nWith no filter or search and no work orders, the views show the design's first-run state instead of the filtered empty state.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS1-N1c: \"When no filter and no search are active and the filter view has no work orders at all, Tech View and Board View show the design's first-run state: the clipboard-list icon in a grey circle, 'No work orders yet', then 'Create a work order and assign a technician to see it here.', with a Create Work Order button that does the same as the page's Create Work Order button. List keeps its production empty state.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v55|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S1-N1c, S1-R9a).\n\nh3. Actual (origin/develop, 2026-10-15)\n\nBoth views show the filtered empty state (magnifier and \"No work orders found.\") whether or not a filter or search is active. \"No work orders found.\" is not in the PRD or the design.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* With no filter or search and an empty filter view, both views show the clipboard icon, both lines of text word for word, and a Create Work Order button that opens the same flow as the page button.\n* With a filter or search active and no matches, the filtered states in S1-N1a and S1-N1b show instead.\n* List is unchanged.\n\nFrom the PRD v54/v55 rulings on Bilal's and Slavcho's questions, 2026-10-15.","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57902/comment/7881